    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***CITY CENTRE LOCATION / GROUND FLOOR / SECURE DEVELOPMENT / NO RENT CAPS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present to the market  Apt 5, 109 Parnell Street, North City Centre, Dublin 1. This spacious 1 bedroom apartment  comes to the market ready to move in.\r\n  \r\nSituated on the ground floor of this outstanding development in the heart of Dublin’s City Centre, Apartment 5 enjoys a very peaceful location strategically located away from the hustle and bustle of city life. The accommodation comprises an entrance hall with a large storage closet, a generous living room with a separate fully equipped fitted kitchen, spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a fully tiled bathroom complete the internal space.\r\n\r\nThis really is an excellent opportunity to acquire a very soothing and tranquil urban living space perfectly located to enjoy all the City Centre has to offer. from The Mater Hospital, Dorset Street, Phibsboro  and close proximity to the City Centre offering every conceivable amenity the city and surrounds has to offer with the IIac and Jervis Shopping Centres just a 10 minute stroll. \r\n\r\nOn its doorstep is Mount Joy Park offering a peaceful retreat from the hustle and bustle of urban living. It's central location makes it ideal for public transport with numerous Bus Routes and the new LUAS Cross City stop close by.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate everything this property has to offer."
      },
